# Per-bot start/stop scripts written by the launcher's "Create New Bot" flow —
# generated artifacts for a specific machine's bots, same as bots/ itself.
# Ignore them all, then re-include the platform's own hand-written scripts, so
# a new bot slug can never accidentally match one of ours.
start_*.bat
stop_*.bat
!start_all.bat
!stop_all.bat
!start_tech.bat
!stop_tech.bat
!start_demo_tunnel.bat
